#
# The folder of the libclang that the wheel mise.toml installs on Linux,
# or the LLVM mise.rust.toml installs on x64 Windows, carries, for
# clang-sys, which bindgen loads it with. mise.toml loads this file only
# where one of the two is installed.
LIBCLANG_PATH=${FLEDGE_LIBCLANG}
